---
// About page: Why Clients Trust Us
---

<section id="about-trust" class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-[32px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif text-center mb-12">
      Why Clients Trust Us
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] pl-5 py-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-[#C1272D]">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
            <path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-2">Insider Knowledge</h3>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          With a former IRS Chief Counsel attorney on our team, we understand the IRS from the inside out — and use that knowledge to your advantage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] pl-5 py-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-[#C1272D]">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
            <path d="M16 11c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S17.66 5 16 5c-1.66 0-3 1.34-3 3s1.34 3 3 3zm-8 0c1.66 0 2.99-1.34 2.99-3S9.66 5 8 5C6.34 5 5 6.34 5 8s1.34 3 3 3zm0 2c-2.33 0-7 1.17-7 3.5V19h14v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5zm8 0c-.29 0-.62.02-.97.05 1.16.84 1.97 1.97 1.97 3.45V19h6v-2.5c0-2.33-4.67-3.5-7-3.5z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-2">Personal Attention</h3>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          Your case is handled directly by an attorney, not passed to a paralegal. We take the time to understand your situation and explain every step.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] pl-5 py-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#C1272D]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-[#C1272D]">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
            <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-2">Proven Advocacy</h3>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          Nearly four decades of resolving audits, collections, appeals, and bankruptcies have taught us what works — and how to get results.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
